## 4. REST API — implement after 2

Detail: `30-rest.md` § 1-5.

| Decision | Value |
|---|---|
| Endpoint | `POST /api/v1/users` → `201` + `Location` |
| Errors | malformed payload `400` · email in use `409` · unexpected `500` with `traceId` |
| Idempotency | `Idempotency-Key` required |
| Pagination | none — no collection |
| Dependencies | springdoc (version already in `pom.xml`), tracing bridge, validation |

