## 4.5 Security — conditional, implement right after 4

Detail: `32-seguranca.md` § 1-10. When step 3b was skipped: `none` and the skip row — e.g.
"authenticated, covered by the chain's deny-by-default".

| Decision | Value |
|---|---|
| Mechanism | OAuth2 resource server, signed token — NEW (first secured case) |
| Access | `POST /api/v1/users` → role `USER_ADMIN`, method security on the controller |
| Public paths | OpenAPI document and UI; `/actuator/health`, `/actuator/info` — reasons in § 1 |
| Ownership | none |
| Failures | no token `401` + `WWW-Authenticate` · without `USER_ADMIN` `403` |
| Setup | `SecurityConfig`, `JwtResourceServerConfig`, Problem Details handlers, `SecurityExceptionHandler`, `Roles` — all NEW |
| Dependencies | `spring-boot-starter-security`, `spring-boot-starter-security-oauth2-resource-server` — managed by the Boot parent |

Implemented by the executor's Block S.

