## Implementation order (checklist)

Fixed at 19 steps, the executor's checkpoints. A step this case doesn't need is marked
`n/a` with the reason — never deleted.

- [ ] 1. Domain exceptions (`10-dominio.md` § 2)
- [ ] 2. Value objects + constructor validation
- [ ] 3. Aggregate + invariants
- [ ] 4. Events — n/a, none
- [ ] 5. Use case command
- [ ] 6. Use case (port and implementation per the blueprint vocabulary)
- [ ] 7. Output ports
- [ ] 8. Migration — materialize from `20-persistencia.md` § 4
- [ ] 9. Persistence entity
- [ ] 10. Spring Data interface
- [ ] 11. Repository adapter
- [ ] 12. Persistence properties
- [ ] 13. DTOs + manual mapper
- [ ] 14. Controller + contract interface + `ApiExceptionHandler`
- [ ] 15. Idempotency interceptor + `IdempotentExecution` wiring (first time: store + component) + REST properties
- [ ] 16. Test fixtures
- [ ] 17. Unit tests
- [ ] 18. Integration + contract tests
- [ ] 19. `./mvnw verify` — green build, coverage gate

