## Resolved divergences

Audit only. **The blocks above already carry the winning value** — whoever implements
doesn't need to read this section. One line per fact that two partials fixed
differently; empty when there were none.

| Fact | Discarded value | Adopted value | Decided by |
|---|---|---|---|
| Invalid payload status | `422` (`00-caso-de-uso.md`) | `400` | `30-rest.md` — `422` is reserved for business-rule violations |

